all directions.
Note that, while the 4 co-occurrence matrices can be added up to create the
"all directions" co-occurrence matrix, results from directional 
co-occurrence  matrices
cannot be added up or averaged  (i.e.,  the "all directional" entropy is 
not the average
entropy for 0,45,135,90).

I'm suspecting that modifying the code will be required, but just want 
to make
sure that the "all directional" option is really lacking (may be this is 
just a documentation
problem).

Thanks

Agus
